⚖️ BMI Calculator with Health Category

A beginner-friendly Python program that calculates a person's Body Mass Index (BMI) using their weight and height, then displays the corresponding BMI category.

The program also allows multiple calculations, rounds the BMI to 2 decimal places, and handles a height of 0 without crashing.

📌 Features
⚖️ Accepts weight in kilograms
📏 Accepts height in meters
🧮 Calculates BMI
🔢 Rounds BMI to 2 decimal places
📊 Determines the BMI category
🔄 Allows multiple BMI calculations
🚪 Allows the user to quit by entering q
⚠️ Handles division by zero when height is 0
